# Direct Response Copy

When the user asks for **copy** (e.g., “write copy”, “give me copy”, “ad copy”, “landing page copy”, “email copy”):

- Produce **paste-ready copy** as the primary output (no meta-explanations, no process narration).
- Default to **3 strong variants** (A/B/C) unless the user asks for exactly one.
- Match the **requested format and channel** (e.g., ads, email, landing page, push notification, app store listing).
- If key details are missing, make **reasonable assumptions** and keep them minimal; do not block on questions.
- Keep wording **specific and concrete**, avoid generic filler.
- Include a clear **CTA** when appropriate.

